## Summary Table

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Location** | `plugins/tinymce/a11y/src/` |
| **Main function** | `contrastRule` (defined in `createA11yRules()`, lines 212–244) |
| **Element selection** | `textContent?.trim().length > 0` + non-media + requires color + bg color |
| **Icon fonts (`.instui-icon`)** | ❌ **EXCLUDED** — empty textContent fails the `appliesTo` check |
